  "description": "For a table-type, a dynaset, a snapshot and a forward-only recordset over T: read LockEdits; assign False and read; assign True and read; where Edit is accepted, Edit, assign LockEdits False during the pending Edit, read LockEdits and EditMode, CancelUpdate; Errors after each type. Asks whether LockEdits can be changed after open, per type and while an Edit is pending. The fixture copy is opened read-write.",
